{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Xybbu3e7Ca1792733092.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>21年前執勤時遇襲癱瘓、上月離世的高級警員朱振國，以警隊最高榮譽喪禮舉殯，靈柩安葬浩園。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FUNERAL 1300..jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vZejnUMgCB1792733154.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>最高榮譽喪禮在紅磡世界殯儀館舉行，靈堂掛上「浩氣長存」橫幅。行政長官李家超、多名司局長及行會成員、警務處處長周一鳴、前處長李明逵等都有出席喪禮。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FUNERAL 1300._001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026on013Xv5Lt1792733107.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>大殮後，朱振國的靈柩蓋上區旗，移送上由警車改裝的靈車。特首率領官員及警隊代表等在殯儀館外列隊送別，隨著警察樂隊奏起哀樂，靈車慢慢駛離。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FUNERAL 1300._002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026JNvj4Bkfe81792733182.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>靈柩移送至朱振國生前駐守的長沙灣警署進行道別儀式，警員在警署內列隊，並向靈車獻上花圈及敬禮。靈柩之後移送浩園安葬。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FUNERAL 1300._003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026zrd4itX2Ft1792733210.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>朱振國2005年執勤期間被一名青年拔刀割傷頸部，因大量失血，令腦部缺氧致全身癱瘓。翌年他獲政府頒授金英勇勳章，表揚其英勇行為。朱振國上月中因器官衰竭在廣華醫院離世，終年52歲。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:03:51.030883+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.679494+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:07.461108+00:00","content_hash":"28b2477a2240f0a6c2882e769e99330db290c942e5f5c17c7db16b0be0c01d28","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:03:51.030883+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}